Reload check (used to verify persistence):
```python
import joblib
from src.config import MODEL_PATH, PREPROCESSOR_PATH, FEATURE_COLUMNS
from src.data import load_data
m = joblib.load(MODEL_PATH); pre = joblib.load(PREPROCESSOR_PATH)
df = load_data().head(5)
print(m.predict_proba(pre.transform(df[FEATURE_COLUMNS]))[:, 1])
# -> [0.016 0.664 0.046 0.405 0.931]  (actual: [0, 1, 0, 0, 1])
```

